sequenceDiagram
    participant PlatformOp as Platform Operator
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Controller as Trainer Controller
    participant JobSetOp as JobSet Operator CRD
    participant ConfigMap as odh-trainer-config<br/>ConfigMap
    participant Kustomize as Manifest Renderer<br/>(odh-platform-utilities)
    participant Metrics as Metrics Server<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>(ServiceMonitor)
    participant TLSWatcher as TLS Profile Watcher
    participant APIServer as OpenShift APIServer

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over PlatformOp,Controller: Reconciliation Flow
        PlatformOp->>K8sAPI: Create Trainer CR<br/>(components.platform.opendatahub.io/v1alpha1)
        K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event: Trainer CR created
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Check JobSetOperator CRD availability
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: JobSetOperator status
        alt JobSetOperator not available
            Controller-->>K8sAPI: Update Trainer status (blocked)
        else JobSetOperator available
            Controller->>K8sAPI: Ensure target namespace exists
            K8sAPI-->>Controller: Namespace ready
            Controller->>ConfigMap: Read platform version info
            ConfigMap-->>Controller: Version metadata
            Controller->>Kustomize: Render Kubeflow Trainer v2 manifests<br/>(kustomize overlays)
            Kustomize-->>Controller: Rendered manifests
            Controller->>K8sAPI: Server-Side Apply manifests<br/>(CRDs, Deployments, RBAC, Webhooks,<br/>NetworkPolicies, ImageStreams)
            K8sAPI-->>Controller: Applied
            Controller->>K8sAPI: Monitor deployment readiness
            K8sAPI-->>Controller: Deployment status
            Controller->>K8sAPI: Garbage collect stale resources<br/>(orphaned from prior releases)
            Controller->>K8sAPI: Update Trainer CR status
        end
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over Metrics,Prometheus: Metrics & Observability Flow
        Prometheus->>Metrics: GET /metrics<br/>HTTPS/8443
        Metrics->>K8sAPI: TokenReview (validate identity)
        K8sAPI-->>Metrics: Token valid
        Metrics->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview (authorize)
        K8sAPI-->>Metrics: Authorized
        Metrics-->>Prometheus: Metrics response
    end

    rect rgb(245, 255, 230)
        Note over TLSWatcher,APIServer: TLS Lifecycle Flow
        Controller->>APIServer: Resolve cluster TLS profile<br/>(OpenShift APIServer resource)
        APIServer-->>Controller: TLS profile (Intermediate default)
        Controller->>Metrics: Apply TLS configuration
        TLSWatcher->>APIServer: Watch for TLS profile changes
        APIServer-->>TLSWatcher: Profile changed event
        TLSWatcher->>Controller: Trigger graceful restart
    end

    rect rgb(245, 230, 255)
        Note over Controller,K8sAPI: Health Probe Flow
        Note right of Controller: :8081/healthz (HTTP, no auth)<br/>:8081/readyz (HTTP, no auth)
    end
